# visionOS 空间 UI 开发

## 核心概念

visionOS（Apple Vision Pro，2024 年发布）将 SwiftUI 从平面屏幕扩展到三维空间。开发者使用相同的声明式范式构建窗口（Window）、体积（Volume）和沉浸式空间（ImmersiveSpace），区别在于视图可以拥有深度（Z 轴）、空间手势替代触摸、RealityKit 渲染 3D 内容。核心 API 包括 `RealityView`（桥接 RealityKit Entity 到 SwiftUI）、`ImmersiveSpace`（全沉浸场景）、空间手势（SpatialTapGesture、DragGesture 的 3D 变体）和 Attachments（将 SwiftUI View 锚定到 3D 实体上）。

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph visionOS App Scenes
        W[WindowGroup] -->|2D 内容| FlatUI[标准 SwiftUI View]
        V[WindowGroup style: .volumetric] -->|3D 体积| Volume[带深度的 SwiftUI + RealityView]
        I[ImmersiveSpace] -->|全沉浸| Immersive[RealityView + 空间音频]
    end
    subgraph 交互层
        Eye[眼动追踪] --> Hover[.hoverEffect]
        Hand[手势识别] --> Spatial[SpatialTapGesture / DragGesture]
        Spatial --> Entity[RealityKit Entity]
    end
    subgraph 渲染层
        Entity --> RK[RealityKit 渲染管线]
        FlatUI --> Glass[玻璃材质窗口]
    end
```

| 场景类型       | 用途                       | SwiftUI API                                |
| -------------- | -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
| Window         | 标准 2D 界面（浮动窗口）   | `WindowGroup { }`                          |
| Volume         | 带深度的 3D 内容框         | `WindowGroup { }.windowStyle(.volumetric)` |
| ImmersiveSpace | 全沉浸体验（占据整个视野） | `ImmersiveSpace(id:) { }`                  |
| Ornament       | 附着在窗口边缘的辅助 UI    | `.ornament(attachmentAnchor:)`             |

## 项目结构与 Scene 声明

```swift
@main
struct SpatialApp: App {
    var body: some Scene {
        // 主窗口（2D）
        WindowGroup {
            ContentView()
        }

        // 3D 体积窗口
        WindowGroup(id: "model-viewer") {
            ModelViewerVolume()
        }
        .windowStyle(.volumetric)
        .defaultSize(width: 0.5, height: 0.5, depth: 0.5, in: .meters)

        // 沉浸式空间
        ImmersiveSpace(id: "solar-system") {
            SolarSystemView()
        }
        .immersionStyle(selection: .constant(.mixed), in: .mixed, .full)
    }
}
```

打开/关闭沉浸式空间：

```swift
struct ContentView: View {
    @Environment(\.openImmersiveSpace) private var openImmersiveSpace
    @Environment(\.dismissImmersiveSpace) private var dismissImmersiveSpace
    @State private var isImmersed = false

    var body: some View {
        Toggle("进入太阳系", isOn: $isImmersed)
            .onChange(of: isImmersed) { _, newValue in
                Task {
                    if newValue {
                        await openImmersiveSpace(id: "solar-system")
                    } else {
                        await dismissImmersiveSpace()
                    }
                }
            }
    }
}
```

## RealityView 桥接 3D 内容

`RealityView` 是 SwiftUI 与 RealityKit 的桥梁，类似于 UIViewRepresentable 的 3D 版本：

```swift
struct GlobeView: View {
    var body: some View {
        RealityView { content in
            // 加载 3D 模型
            guard let earth = try? await ModelEntity(named: "Earth") else { return }
            earth.scale = SIMD3(repeating: 0.3)
            earth.position = [0, 0, 0]

            // 添加旋转动画
            let rotation = FromToByAnimation<Transform>(
                from: .init(rotation: simd_quatf(angle: 0, axis: [0, 1, 0])),
                to: .init(rotation: simd_quatf(angle: .pi * 2, axis: [0, 1, 0])),
                duration: 30,
                isAdditive: true,
                repeatMode: .repeat
            )
            let resource = try? AnimationResource.generate(with: rotation)
            if let resource { earth.playAnimation(resource) }

            content.add(earth)
        } update: { content in
            // 响应 SwiftUI 状态变化更新 3D 内容
        }
        .gesture(
            SpatialTapGesture()
                .targetedToAnyEntity()
                .onEnded { value in
                    // 处理空间点击
                    print("Tapped entity at \(value.location3D)")
                }
        )
    }
}
```

## Attachments：将 SwiftUI 锚定到 3D 实体

Attachments 允许将标准 SwiftUI View 渲染为 3D 空间中的面片，锚定到 RealityKit Entity：

```swift
struct AnnotatedModel: View {
    var body: some View {
        RealityView { content, attachments in
            guard let model = try? await ModelEntity(named: "Heart") else { return }
            model.scale = SIMD3(repeating: 0.5)
            content.add(model)

            // 锚定标注
            if let annotation = attachments.entity(for: "info-label") {
                annotation.position = [0.2, 0.3, 0]
                model.addChild(annotation)
            }
        } attachments: {
            Attachment(id: "info-label") {
                VStack {
                    Text("左心室")
                        .font(.title2)
                    Text("负责将血液泵入主动脉")
                        .font(.caption)
                }
                .padding()
                .glassBackgroundEffect()
            }
        }
    }
}
```

## 空间手势系统

visionOS 的手势基于手部追踪，SwiftUI 提供了空间版手势：

```swift
struct InteractiveOrb: View {
    @State private var position: SIMD3<Float> = .zero

    var body: some View {
        RealityView { content in
            let orb = ModelEntity(mesh: .generateSphere(radius: 0.1))
            orb.components.set(InputTargetComponent())
            orb.components.set(CollisionComponent(shapes: [.generateSphere(radius: 0.1)]))
            content.add(orb)
        }
        .gesture(
            DragGesture()
                .targetedToAnyEntity()
                .onChanged { value in
                    value.entity.position = value.convert(value.location3D, from: .local, to: .scene)
                }
        )
    }
}
```

关键组件要求：

- `InputTargetComponent`：标记 Entity 可接收输入
- `CollisionComponent`：定义碰撞体积用于命中测试
- `HoverEffectComponent`：眼动注视时的视觉反馈

## Ornament 窗口附件

Ornament 是附着在窗口边缘的辅助控制面板：

```swift
struct MainWindow: View {
    var body: some View {
        NavigationSplitView { /* sidebar */ } detail: { /* content */ }
            .ornament(attachmentAnchor: .scene(.bottom)) {
                HStack {
                    Button("播放", systemImage: "play.fill") { }
                    Button("暂停", systemImage: "pause.fill") { }
                    Slider(value: $progress)
                }
                .padding()
                .glassBackgroundEffect()
            }
    }
}
```

## 小结

- visionOS 用同一套 SwiftUI 声明式 API 构建 Window、Volume 和 ImmersiveSpace 三种场景
- RealityView 是 SwiftUI 与 RealityKit 的桥梁，支持异步加载模型和实时更新
- Attachments 将 SwiftUI View 渲染为 3D 空间中的面片，实现信息标注
- 空间手势需要 InputTargetComponent + CollisionComponent 才能命中 Entity
- 从 iOS SwiftUI 迁移到 visionOS 的改动主要在 Scene 声明和手势层，核心业务逻辑可复用

